      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:424f5031f4c3d7f1fd2edefbeffcf1dd8997f9a1ce4e44829b4b3d9914e27384",
      "text": "改编自推理小说的舞台剧工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c82b44850456be1036d60a6fba53b38c5f490b41f63395c3be293ecbde5aeaa",
      "text": "“等等！这道痕迹明显很反常。\n恐怕是凶手故意留下来的吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65d82027464f1cf5517b0329d1b324db0a10b65e5c44d904c97b6958d40ddf3c",
      "text": "“先去找相关人员问问话！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83f4f5240e95075de7efdcd43dd9beb8230fd0e47f7072e130c88237599f68fe",
      "text": "呼～。●●●●プロデューサー君，\n感觉怎么样喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7083754af46850a46f6b6408300f0704194ded81bfa4f283cc4e2ce913c6009",
      "text": "非常棒！\n让人十分期待接下来的剧情，紧张感十足呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1b2ffbbc02c34e51d08cfbb49ac2b806078f950253dfc0fa2f201426caeb809",
      "text": "刚拿到剧本没多久，\n就能演绎到这种地步……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2313bd8a48ff924fd97cab356bc71556e0c6f59301c7b88365518339bdca2a",
      "text": "吾辈在曲艺场上可是要分饰形形色色的角色\n是也。演戏吾辈很拿手喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3009b6c2ccc23069f1d3c47f9094b3963243616728a309967fd7e3962c557866",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君。\n练习室现在还可以用喵？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad2fd45ba82d6d10b46dbe1dd0c6e432b4602bf788d92529b3ef5bb1854b6ff4",
      "text": "是的，还可以用哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da81bfc4c8c1fe499f30c270b02bc1aeac9e1cfb5254a6068d53e844cb61e36b",
      "text": "既然如此，吾辈就再去练习一会儿是也。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_017kir_1_5_017_04:1_5_017_04:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98014a402a4abf358c15c24df0b26cadf9d8fd6ddff09c2fb0e1ded8bfe20fe2",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君也能\n陪着吾辈的话，吾辈会很高兴的喵♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
